WEBVTT

00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:07.020
The G-Park 3rd Anniversary event is about to reach its climax!

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:10.150
The Electric Light Parade is going to start right now!

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:55.860
A mysterious robot suddenly appears before Mamoru and his friends...

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:59.120
What is its true identity?

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:13.970
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:27.830
This is the story of the brave men and women...

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:30.790
...who fight with all their hearts to save mankind.

00:02:33.090 --> 00:02:33.130
The Voice of Destruction

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:35.710
<i>The Voice of Destruction</i>

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:49.980
This is a going-away present!

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:55.820
Thank you, Swan!

00:02:56.150 --> 00:02:58.280
I wish you'd just stay in Japan...

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:01.660
Do you really have to go back to America now?

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:08.080
Yes, we've finished our tour of Japan, and the necessary data input is done.

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:11.000
No! No! Mic doesn't want to go home!

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:14.040
I wanna stay with Mamoru and the others forever!

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:15.340
Mic!

00:03:15.590 --> 00:03:17.130
Don't look so sad!

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:19.220
You're gonna make me start bawlin' too!

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:25.390
Mic!

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:27.520
Oh, my friends!

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:30.350
I'm coming back no matter what, okay?

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:32.270
Okay! We'll be waiting for you!

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:34.020
That's a promise!

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:36.190
Pinky swear, all right?

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:38.820
Oh, yes! That's a pinky swear!

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:41.030
Mic!

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:44.910
I'll be back!

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:47.080
Take care of yourself, Uncle Liger.

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:49.250
Don't croak anytime soon, Big Brother.

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:51.870
You take care, too.

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:54.750
See you again, folks!

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:06.260
Take care, now!

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:08.720
We'll visit you in America someday, okay?

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:11.600
Say hello to my brother!

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:15.860
Oh, well, they're gone now.

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:18.070
Oh no, look at the time!

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:21.440
We'd better get going or we'll be late for the closing ceremony!

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:22.950
No problem!

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:27.120
I can give you all a ride in my car!

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:33.080
Big Brother Gai!

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:36.630
What's with that woman!

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:38.920
Hanging all over my Super-cool D.F.L!

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:50.640
How about some cold, delicious ice cream?

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:54.810
Vanilla, chocolate, strawberry ice cream, anybody?

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:58.150
Does he have to make all that racket this early?

00:04:58.310 --> 00:04:59.730
Talk about disturbing the peace!

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:02.570
What, you're charging 6 bucks?

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:05.150
No way am I buying that!

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:09.410
Huh! Listen, I only use the purest ingredients!

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:12.250
So don't compare my product with your run-of-the-mill ice cream!

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:15.040
Ice cream, may I have one, please?

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:22.670
Ice cream, may I have one, please?

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:26.510
Peppermint, may I have one now, please?

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:32.060
Please, no pushing. Board the train in an orderly manner, now!

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:35.390
Line No. 2, stand clear of the closing doors.

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:38.020
For your own safety, please do not run for your train.

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:40.270
Please do not run for your train...

00:05:50.030 --> 00:05:53.910
I swear! Commuters these days just don't listen, not one of them!

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:56.210
Man, I can't take much more of this!

00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:59.170
Now, now, let's not be like that.

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:06.220
I commend you for your duty!

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:20.690
Really now! We're never gonna get to the closing ceremony in time!

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:24.860
I could have my private helicopter get us, but there's no heliport, so...

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:27.360
Oh, I'm sorry!

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:29.910
I'm the one to blame for this disaster!

00:06:30.110 --> 00:06:32.950
I'll commit seppuku or anything you wish, so please forgive me!

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:37.040
At least, that's what my car navigation system is saying!

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:41.710
You had us for a moment there...

00:06:42.710 --> 00:06:43.460
Zonder!

00:06:43.630 --> 00:06:45.630
What the heck is that?

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:53.760
It's a monster!

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:56.270
Help me somebody!

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:00.440
Swan!

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:03.230
Okay! I'm going to contact GGG right now!

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:18.950
Oh, it's Baribarien!

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:22.750
Hello, everybody! I came back, just like I promised!

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:24.670
Cause we made a pinky swear, right?

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:26.130
Mic!

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:31.470
We're in big trouble! The 13th has escaped again!

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:33.470
You've got to find him right away!

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:36.010
I'm counting on you, Leo! Gai!

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:38.350
Counting on us? But...

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:40.180
What about you?

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:44.440
Unfortunately I've got tickets for a Broadway musical tonight...

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:46.110
...so thanks in advance!

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:50.530
How can he be so irresponsible?

00:07:53.660 --> 00:07:55.370
No hard feelings, Leo!

00:07:55.570 --> 00:07:56.990
You heard what's going on...

00:07:57.120 --> 00:08:00.080
Volfogg, I need you to pinpoint Mic Sounders' location right away!

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:01.290
That won't be necessary.

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:06.210
Even as we speak, Mic is interacting with Special Agent Mamoru.

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:09.960
System Change!

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:20.730
Volfogg!

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:23.640
I am now going to bring Mic Sounders into custody...

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:29.360
...that was the plan, but I'm afraid he's escaped.

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:31.820
I guess it can't be helped. I'll go bring him back...

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:33.280
Hold on, Gai!

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:37.370
I'm detecting traces of Elementary Particle Z0 in Tokyo Area 16S.

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:38.330
It's a Zonder!

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:49.880
EnRyu and I will protect you all!

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:52.050
We need you to stay calm as you evacuate.

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:56.510
Is that the Zonder Robo?

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:58.720
Pretty weird shape, huh?

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:01.770
What about the closing ceremony?

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:03.560
Hey, forget about that!

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:07.060
This is like having ringside seats to watch the GGG robots in action!

00:09:07.350 --> 00:09:08.560
It's dangerous!

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:10.570
You go back right now!

00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:12.070
Don't worry!

00:09:12.230 --> 00:09:15.360
If things get hairy I can escape in Baribarien!

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:26.210
Are you sure you'll be okay?

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:27.880
Hey! Look at that!

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:37.180
Captain! The civilian evacuation is complete!

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:40.100
The Zonder Robo shows no signs of attacking.

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:41.760
What the heck is he up to?

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:44.890
Gai! We've confirmed another Zonder reaction!

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:45.520
What?

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:55.900
So they're gonna attack from both sides, huh?

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:58.570
We're gonna have to crush them both before they make a move!

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:03.120
What's this sound?

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:08.370
It's like ultrasound!

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:10.540
What a racket those Zonders are making!

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:18.050
What is this?

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:19.590
No way!

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:37.440
My whole body...

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:40.320
...all the G-Liquid's gushing out!

00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:44.080
Captain!

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:51.000
Dear God!

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:53.170
My Super-cool D.F.L!

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:54.670
What the heck is going on?

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:58.300
Oh! Can you feel all that ultrasound?

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:00.510
Big Brother Gai!

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:01.760
This isn't good!

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:03.720
Gai! HyoRyu! EnRyu!

00:11:03.850 --> 00:11:05.680
You've got to get yourselves out of there now!

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:09.640
It's no good! If that G-Liquid doesn't stop leaking soon...

00:11:09.890 --> 00:11:12.610
...they'll end up so debilitated they won't even be able to walk!

00:11:12.690 --> 00:11:13.810
What in the name of God is going on?

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:15.980
It's a targeted attack by ultrasound!

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:18.740
The interference from the ultrasonic wave is...

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:21.160
...causing the G-Liquid to come to an instant boil!

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:23.700
Similar to the mist inside a humidifier.

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:27.080
Is that the reason why our heroes' G-Liquid is gushing out like that?

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:30.040
Curse those Zonders! How dare they pull a stunt like that!

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:32.420
Gai!

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:42.640
Even our heroes have an unexpected Achilles' heel...

00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:45.760
And it is this blood-like substance...

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:49.060
...which conducts the energy produced by...

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:53.270
...the GS-Ride throughout their entire bodies.

00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:59.280
In other words, the loss of their G-Liquid will mean our heroes' death.

00:11:59.570 --> 00:12:01.240
Big Brother Gai!

00:12:11.910 --> 00:12:14.920
System Change!

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:24.130
Goldytank!

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:26.600
Three Become One!

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:40.190
Big Volfogg!

00:12:40.400 --> 00:12:42.530
Stop it, Big Volfogg!

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:45.280
The enemy's planning to annihilate you all!

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:46.620
Come back here this minute!

00:12:47.120 --> 00:12:48.530
Do you hear me, Goldy?

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:49.660
That's an order!

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:52.580
Hey, I wouldn't be me if I didn't defy your orders!

00:12:52.830 --> 00:12:54.750
I am prepared to accept any penalty!

00:12:56.710 --> 00:12:58.590
The Zonders are under attack, guys!

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:00.000
Oh! What's that?

00:13:00.380 --> 00:13:01.710
Goldytank!

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:03.090
Big Volfogg!

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:05.220
Melting Siren!

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:12.100
Marg Cannon!

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:18.400
Finishing move, Whirling Death Strike!

00:13:22.650 --> 00:13:23.530
All right!

00:13:23.610 --> 00:13:24.490
Get those Zonders!

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:30.200
That's showing them!

00:13:45.050 --> 00:13:46.010
What the...

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:47.510
Did they somehow power-up?

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:56.600
What the heck?

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:04.570
We've done a splendid job of eradicating those pests.

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:08.860
Indeed, since we used 2 samples of our precious Zonder metal this time!

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:11.280
All we have to do now is wait!

00:14:11.740 --> 00:14:16.210
Yes, just sit back and wait while our little Zonders grow up...

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:22.880
This is it, you guys!

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:24.670
What's going to happen to us?

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:26.050
I'm not afraid, I'm not afraid!

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:28.760
We have no choice now!

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:31.220
We're going to use Bullet X!

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:32.140
What?

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:33.100
Are you serious?

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:37.100
Both EI-23 and 24 are emitting ultrasound!

00:14:37.310 --> 00:14:38.730
The target of their attack is...

00:14:39.100 --> 00:14:40.400
Here, the Bay Tower Base Station!

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:41.310
What did you say?

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:42.230
No!

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:46.190
They're going to increase the intensity of the ultrasonic wave by...

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:48.150
...concentrating the blast at a single point!

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:50.860
Impact from the Zonder ultrasonic wave in 3 seconds!

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:51.820
...2!

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:52.700
...1!

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:09.680
Oh! I can't reach the Main Order Room!

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:13.550
Zonders! They're such a bunch of bad guys!

00:15:14.050 --> 00:15:16.970
Look what they did to everybody at GGG...

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:18.520
They're not gonna get away with it!

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:21.900
Just watch, I'm gonna take care of them right now!

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:23.730
Let's fight!

00:15:25.520 --> 00:15:26.780
Don't go, Mic!

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:29.240
You really don't stand a chance against those Zonders!

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:30.740
I'll be fine!

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:35.200
I'm gonna show them my strong fighting spirit!

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:37.080
Mic!

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:46.460
The time has come for my power to be resurrected!

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:47.840
So here I go!

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:50.550
System Change!

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:54.600
I can't transform!

00:15:59.560 --> 00:16:02.350
I'm gonna get blasted by the ultrasound...

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:10.360
No good after all, huh?

00:16:10.440 --> 00:16:12.740
He's headed this way!

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:13.910
Mic!

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:21.830
Oh, my God!

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:24.790
System Change!

00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:38.260
Mic Sounders the 13th!

00:16:46.690 --> 00:16:49.020
Mic! Did you transform?

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:50.360
Yes!

00:16:50.440 --> 00:16:53.030
So that robot who saved us all at the amusement park...

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:54.990
...that was you after all, right?

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:57.410
You can leave the rest to me now!

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:01.250
Sound, standby!

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:03.960
Come on, rock 'n' roll!

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:09.290
Disc M, set on!

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:14.510
Razzle-Dazzle Double V!

00:17:38.660 --> 00:17:40.330
Zo, zo, zo...

00:17:41.240 --> 00:17:45.960
The Sound Robot developed in the USA, Mic Sounders the 13th...

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:50.920
The music emanating from Mic's Disc M delivers tremendous microwaves...

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:54.300
...that have the power to paralyze certain mecha functions.

00:17:54.590 --> 00:17:55.670
Zo, zo, zo...

00:17:59.390 --> 00:18:04.470
Disc P, out and set on!

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:09.650
Thundering V!

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:15.990
Desire... Vividly...

00:18:15.860 --> 00:18:19.450
Desire... Soaring away now...

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:22.990
Desire... Transcending time...

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:26.540
Desire... Dazzle my eyes as you dance!

00:18:26.460 --> 00:18:30.080
Desire... Vividly...

00:18:30.040 --> 00:18:33.550
Desire... Soaring away now...

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:37.170
Desire... Transcending time...

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:40.510
What's this song?

00:18:41.510 --> 00:18:44.720
I can feel the power flowing throughout my body!

00:18:45.220 --> 00:18:48.770
The sounds emanating from Disc P are delivering energy waves...

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:52.520
...that can swiftly activate the power of the GS-Ride!

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:54.440
Yeah!

00:18:54.730 --> 00:18:56.030
Yay!

00:18:56.110 --> 00:18:57.360
Attaboy, Mic!

00:18:57.570 --> 00:18:59.910
Zo, zo, Zonder!

00:19:02.240 --> 00:19:05.660
Zo, zo, zo...

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:12.790
Oh! You wanna combine, baby?

00:19:19.010 --> 00:19:22.720
Okay! I can take care of the Zonders' ultrasonic attack.

00:19:23.220 --> 00:19:25.970
So get yourselves ready to attack, GGG!

00:19:26.260 --> 00:19:27.890
Right! I'm counting on you, Mic!

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:31.100
Backup power, connection complete!

00:19:32.350 --> 00:19:34.860
All right, then! Final Fusion, approved!

00:19:35.020 --> 00:19:36.020
Roger!

00:19:36.110 --> 00:19:37.530
Final Fusion...

00:19:37.780 --> 00:19:39.780
Program... drive!

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:47.330
Final Fusion!

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:50.370
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:19:50.370 --> 00:19:53.080
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:19:54.580 --> 00:19:56.750
Melting Siren!

00:20:00.600 --> 00:20:04.530
Run, you powerful Robot Brigade!

00:20:06.440 --> 00:20:11.020
With your red gaze and your silver chest!

00:20:12.350 --> 00:20:15.290
The G-Stone is your bond with the lion

00:20:15.290 --> 00:20:19.800
to save the future of outer space.

00:20:20.060 --> 00:20:23.490
It's time to launch!

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:27.040
Destroying the souls of the people...

00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:30.950
Smash the Zonder Metal to pieces!

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:34.000
GaoGaiGar!

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:35.750
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:20:35.750 --> 00:20:38.790
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:38.090
All right! Let's do it, Goldy!

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:39.130
Okay!

00:20:38.790 --> 00:20:41.640
Final Fusion, approved!

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:41.880
System Change!

00:20:41.640 --> 00:20:44.690
Now transform into a superhero!

00:20:44.690 --> 00:20:47.850
Pulverizing steel!

00:20:47.850 --> 00:20:51.750
Goldion Hammer!

00:20:53.420 --> 00:20:59.090
Magic! Drive! Ultimate power! Guts!

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:56.440
Goldion Hammer...

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:59.110
Activation, approved!

00:20:59.290 --> 00:21:05.090
A hero is born! Great God of Iron...

00:21:01.820 --> 00:21:02.690
Roger!

00:21:02.860 --> 00:21:04.490
Goldion Hammer...

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:08.240
Safety device, relieve!

00:21:05.090 --> 00:21:08.090
Our very own King of Braves!

00:21:08.100 --> 00:21:12.100
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:21:23.840 --> 00:21:25.880
Take 'em out, GaoGaiGar!

00:21:26.430 --> 00:21:28.930
Hammer Hell!

00:21:31.680 --> 00:21:34.560
Hammer Heaven!

00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:47.530
Transform into light!

00:22:03.800 --> 00:22:06.260
GaoGaiGar, you're very, very strong!

00:22:06.590 --> 00:22:09.140
You Japanese robots are the bomb!

00:22:09.640 --> 00:22:13.270
Who knew his protection device could be disabled so easily...

00:22:13.930 --> 00:22:15.310
Dr. Liger!

00:22:15.520 --> 00:22:16.940
It's okay, it's okay...

00:22:17.100 --> 00:22:19.770
This gives us a chance to gather battle data...

00:22:19.940 --> 00:22:20.980
It's dangerous!

00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:25.400
Don't worry, Disc X is still in our hands, remember!

00:22:29.280 --> 00:22:31.910
Mic Sounders the 13th...

00:22:32.160 --> 00:22:36.000
The fact that he carries a crucial secret...

00:22:36.250 --> 00:22:38.920
...capable of causing the annihilation of all mankind...

00:22:39.080 --> 00:22:41.670
...is still unknown to the rest of us.

00:22:46.410 --> 00:22:50.310
You come floating down onto my planet.

00:22:51.510 --> 00:22:55.180
That's the dream I always have.

00:22:56.580 --> 00:23:01.360
Now you're looking up at the sky again...

00:23:01.360 --> 00:23:06.150
and you're searching for me.

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:10.320
Longing to see you and be with you...

00:23:11.490 --> 00:23:17.250
I know I feel it just as strongly as you.

00:23:19.310 --> 00:23:24.010
Give us the wings to fly

00:23:24.010 --> 00:23:28.670
and set off into the galaxy.

00:23:29.360 --> 00:23:34.010
When you and I are grown up...

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:40.910
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:46.690 --> 00:23:49.860
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:50.450 --> 00:23:53.620
The Zonder Robo created from the last of the Zonder Metal has somehow...

00:23:53.910 --> 00:23:58.450
...erased Volfogg, Baribarien, as well as Hana and the others!

00:23:58.950 --> 00:24:00.040
Come on, Mic!

00:24:00.160 --> 00:24:02.870
You've got to help Mamoru find the parallel space!

00:24:03.170 --> 00:24:05.290
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, King of Braves...

00:24:05.340 --> 00:24:06.750
"To the Next Dimension."

00:24:06.630 --> 00:24:06.670
To the Next Dimension

00:24:07.000 --> 00:24:10.470
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:12.430 --> 00:24:15.450
Jet Wapper

00:24:13.340 --> 00:24:14.840
This is the Key to Victory!
